WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:14.040
Settings & connections: business profile, country and currency, contact channels, payment methods and connections. Each item is tested, and only verified ones are shown to customers.

2
00:00:14.587 --> 00:00:24.610
In "Business profile", set the brand name, country, currency, time zone, reply languages and the assistant's tone, then click "Save".

3
00:00:25.162 --> 00:00:33.830
In "Contact channels", enter the phone, WhatsApp, Telegram, email and website, and save each with "Save & test".

4
00:00:34.378 --> 00:00:42.650
In "Payment methods", turn on bank transfer, a "Payment link" or a gateway; each has its own "Step-by-step guide" beside it.

5
00:00:43.202 --> 00:00:49.880
"What the customer sees now" shows what is verified; "Test all" checks everything again.

6
00:00:50.432 --> 00:01:11.430
In the "Public address" card, click "Get a fixed address". With no sign-up and no domain to buy, this computer gets a fixed address on the DMAI Pro server that stays connected during the 7-day trial and for your licence term. If you prefer your own account, a Cloudflare tunnel or ngrok are the two other ways on the same card.

7
00:01:11.978 --> 00:01:18.820
An item that failed its test isn't shown to customers; read the error and fix exactly that.
